[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146364368","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109222#issuecomment-3146364368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109222","id":3146364368,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67ibXQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T08:35:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T08:35:02Z","body":"This change is not correct, this swaps the labels, which match those of the class, before they went `xx`, `xy`, ..., `wz`, `ww`, matching those of the class, now it goes `xx`, `yx`, ..., `zw`, `ww` which breaks the relationship","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146364368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146372302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109222#issuecomment-3146372302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109222","id":3146372302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67idTO","user":{"login":"MP430","id":57238920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjM4OTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57238920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430","html_url":"https://github.com/MP430","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T08:52:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T08:52:53Z","body":"Hmm, I'm not sure about that.\r\n\r\nWith Basis, the xy label corresponds to Basis.y.x. Example:\r\n<img width=\"1194\" height=\"379\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e946b07-6813-40cd-a8b0-33933f1d4645\" />\r\n\r\nThis seems intended, because the documentation for Basis says that they're exposed in column-major order.\r\n\r\nThe documentation also says that Projections are column-major. But, this was backwards.\r\n\r\nBefore my change, I see this, which is unexpected because it's different to Basis:\r\n<img width=\"1196\" height=\"374\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60bc6ded-5eac-4a24-91af-732b67c6dabb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter my change, I see this, which is consistent with Basis:\r\n<img width=\"1193\" height=\"397\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb286042-2e5e-41e3-b464-5b685775ff75\" />\r\n\r\nSo I think this change is correct. Unless the labels for the Basis are also incorrect? ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146372302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146381230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109222#issuecomment-3146381230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109222","id":3146381230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67ifeu","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T09:09:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T09:13:56Z","body":"Hmm, you're right, but that does mean that the way `Basis` is displayed matches the constructor, but not the basis access, with `Projection` it matches in both cases\r\n\r\nI don't think `Projection` is wrong here, this change makes things more confusing, and it breaks the relationship with the code internally:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c2202d36c10661873fb729bcf9c4c00b99e10c7a/core/math/projection.h#L162-L168\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c2202d36c10661873fb729bcf9c4c00b99e10c7a/core/math/basis.h#L207-L212\r\n\r\nBecause of their design they are differently ordered, but the question is if `Basis` should be changed to match the `x`, `y`, and `z` properties, I'd say it should match what you can do with `basis.x.x` and `projection.x.x`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146381230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146383409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109222#issuecomment-3146383409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109222","id":3146383409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67igAx","user":{"login":"MP430","id":57238920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjM4OTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57238920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430","html_url":"https://github.com/MP430","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MP430/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T09:14:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T09:14:27Z","body":"I think projection is definitely wrong, unfortunately, I don't know about the labelling though, maybe that should be swapped everywhere.\r\n\r\nAnother example, using an identity matrix, but with a 1 in the top-right. I'd expect this to create a translation. \r\nBefore change, I get a projection instead:\r\n<img width=\"1087\" height=\"794\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57f50a49-d212-4f85-8a96-63932b01b5cb\" />\r\n\r\nAfter change, I get a translation as expected:\r\n<img width=\"1067\" height=\"737\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7329b5a8-9db1-4232-bd96-cb14c2e25a6a\" />\r\n\r\nSo at least, the positions are wrong. I don't know whether the labelling should be different though.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146383409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146387585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109222#issuecomment-3146387585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109222","id":3146387585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67ihCB","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{